 20000000-0000-0000-0000-000000004393 | business:erp:rebate-settlement:invoice |         3 |         70 | business:erp:rebate-settlement:invoice | 开红字发票（试算票面 + 生成 OUT_RED 票与红字凭证，结算单转「已开红字发票」）
